# Cue is a PUBLIC OAuth client. Register ONE Trakt app at
# https://trakt.tv/oauth/applications and embed its client id here: it is PUBLIC
# (it ships in the built JS and travels in every authorize URL), and there is NO
# client secret because Cue authenticates with OAuth PKCE. Each user then signs
# into their OWN Trakt account; they never enter a client id.
#
# Set the Trakt app's Redirect URI to http://localhost:5199/auth/callback for
# local development, plus <your-production-origin>/auth/callback for deploys.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill it in.
VITE_TRAKT_CLIENT_ID=your_trakt_app_client_id_here
# Dev only: point the whole Trakt surface (API + authorize page) at scripts/mock-trakt instead of the default https://api.trakt.tv
# VITE_TRAKT_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8787
